#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2018-04-27-this-week-in-fdroid.md
msgid "[Ring](https://f-droid.org/packages/cx.ring/) is finally up-to-date again on F-Droid! (And should hopefully not fall behind that much again.) We had to stop accepting updates because Ring introduced the proprietary [GCM](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Cloud_Messaging) push service. Although that was soon made optional, nobody had time to update the build recipe. (Until now.)"
msgstr "[Ring](https://f-droid.org/packages/cx.ring/) が、ようやく F-Droid で再び最新版になりました！（今後はこれほど更新が遅れないことを願っています。）Ring がプロプライエタリな [GCM](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Cloud_Messaging) プッシュサービスを導入したため、更新の受け入れを停止せざるを得ませんでした。その後すぐに GCM は任意になりましたが、ビルドレシピを更新する時間のある人がいませんでした。（今までは。）"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2018-04-27-this-week-in-fdroid.md
msgid "[Telegram](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.telegram.messenger/): Russia doesn't like not being able to spy on people, and has been trying to block Telegram. The upcoming version of Telegram-FOSS will have better chances to connect through the Russian Telegram blocks. If you need it right now you can install the beta build from here: https://github.com/Telegram-FOSS-Team/Telegram-FOSS/releases/tag/v4.6b"
msgstr "[Telegram](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.telegram.messenger/)：ロシアは人々を監視できないことを快く思わず、Telegram の遮断を試みています。次期バージョンの Telegram-FOSS では、ロシアによる Telegram の遮断下でも接続できる可能性が高まります。今すぐ必要な場合は、こちらからベータビルドをインストールできます：https://github.com/Telegram-FOSS-Team/Telegram-FOSS/releases/tag/v4.6b"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2018-04-27-this-week-in-fdroid.md
msgid "[Yalp Store](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.yeriomin.yalpstore/): There is an update for yalp store not being able to find any app updates."
msgstr "[Yalp Store](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.yeriomin.yalpstore/)：Yalp Store でアプリのアップデートを検出できない問題を修正する更新があります。"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2018-04-27-this-week-in-fdroid.md
msgid "**Misc**: Updates for [Conversations](https://f-droid.org/packages/eu.siacs.conversations/), [Nextcloud Talk](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.nextcloud.talk2/), [Telegram](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.telegram.messenger/), [Duck Duck Go](https://f-droid.org/packages/se.johanhil.duckduckgo/), [Firefox Klar](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.mozilla.klar/), [Tusky](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.keylesspalace.tusky/) 1.6.1, [Mastalab](https://f-droid.org/packages/fr.gouv.etalab.mastodon/) 1.8.6, [BRouter](https://f-droid.org/packages/btools.routingapp/) 1.4.11, [Nextcloud](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.nextcloud.client/) 3.1.0 and many more!"
msgstr "**その他**：[Conversations](https://f-droid.org/packages/eu.siacs.conversations/)、[Nextcloud Talk](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.nextcloud.talk2/)、[Telegram](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.telegram.messenger/)、[Duck Duck Go](https://f-droid.org/packages/se.johanhil.duckduckgo/)、[Firefox Klar](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.mozilla.klar/)、[Tusky](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.keylesspalace.tusky/) 1.6.1、[Mastalab](https://f-droid.org/packages/fr.gouv.etalab.mastodon/) 1.8.6、[BRouter](https://f-droid.org/packages/btools.routingapp/) 1.4.11、[Nextcloud](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.nextcloud.client/) 3.1.0 など、多数のアップデートがあります！"

