#, no-wrap
msgid "This Week in F-Droid, Week 20"
msgstr "今週の F-Droid、第 20 週"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-05-17-this-week-in-fdroid-w20.md
#: _posts/2018-05-25-this-week-in-fdroid-w21.md
#: _posts/2018-05-31-this-week-in-fdroid-w22.md
#: _posts/2018-06-07-this-week-in-fdroid-w23.md
