msgstr "[AnySoftKeyboard: Galician](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.anysoftkeyboard.languagepack.galician/)：[AnySoftKeyboard](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.menny.android.anysoftkeyboard/) 用のガリシア語言語パック"

