msgid "[Rosary](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.example.rosary/): A very simple app helping Christian users to pray the Rosary."
msgstr "[Rosary](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.example.rosary/)：キリスト教徒がロザリオの祈りを行うのを支援する、とてもシンプルなアプリ。"

