#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "TWIF 34: F-Droid is a Planet"
msgstr "TWIF 34：F-Droidは惑星"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "In this edition: Planet F-Droid now exists, call for submissions for Planet F-Droid and first article of Izzy's F-Droid series available in English.  There are **{{ page.number_of_added_apps }}** new and **{{ page.number_of_updated_apps }}** updated apps."
msgstr "今回の内容：Planet F-Droidが誕生、Planet F-Droidへの投稿募集、IzzyによるF-Droid連載の第1回記事が英語で公開。新たに**{{ page.number_of_added_apps }}**個のアプリが追加され、**{{ page.number_of_updated_apps }}**個のアプリが更新されました。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Planet F-Droid now exists"
msgstr "Planet F-Droidが誕生"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "F-Droid now has [its own planet](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/planet/), thanks to the hard work of **[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)**, who single-handedly set it all up! A so-called \"planet\" site aggregates the blogs of community members (see [http://planet.fsfe.org](http://planet.fsfe.org) or [https://planet.jabber.org](https://planet.jabber.org) as examples). And if you've been secretly following along via [the forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/planet-f-droid-org-feed-aggregator-for-android-dev-related-blogs/4481), Planet F-Droid now also has [the blog of Gregor Santner](https://gsantner.net/), of **[Markor](https://f-droid.org/packages/net.gsantner.markor/)**, **[MemeTastic](https://f-droid.org/packages/io.github.gsantner.memetastic/)** and **[dandelion\\*](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.dfa.diaspora_android/)** fame."
msgstr "**[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)**が単独で構築してくれたおかげで、F-Droidに[独自のPlanet](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/planet/)が誕生しました！いわゆる「Planet」サイトとは、コミュニティメンバーのブログを集約するサイトです（例：[http://planet.fsfe.org](http://planet.fsfe.org)、[https://planet.jabber.org](https://planet.jabber.org)）。また、[フォーラム](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/planet-f-droid-org-feed-aggregator-for-android-dev-related-blogs/4481)でひそかに動向を追っていた方ならご存じかもしれませんが、Planet F-Droidには、**[Markor](https://f-droid.org/packages/net.gsantner.markor/)**、**[MemeTastic](https://f-droid.org/packages/io.github.gsantner.memetastic/)**、**[dandelion\\*](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.dfa.diaspora_android/)**で知られる[Gregor Santnerのブログ](https://gsantner.net/)も追加されました。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Call for submissions for Planet F-Droid"
msgstr "Planet F-Droidへの投稿募集"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "Hello FOSS Android enthusiasts and project leads! Do you want your FOSS and Android related blog to be included in [Planet F-Droid](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/planet/)? Please have a look at the Planet's [inclusion rules](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/planet/wikis/inclusion-rules), or [read more about it](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/planet/wikis/Planet-F-Droid)."
msgstr "FOSS Androidの愛好者やプロジェクトリーダーの皆さん！FOSSやAndroidに関するご自身のブログを[Planet F-Droid](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/planet/)へ掲載してみませんか？Planetの[掲載ルール](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/planet/wikis/inclusion-rules)を確認するか、[詳細をご覧ください](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/planet/wikis/Planet-F-Droid)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First article of Izzy's F-Droid series available in English"
msgstr "IzzyによるF-Droid連載の第1回記事が英語で公開"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[@Izzy](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/izzy)** [writes](https://mastodon.technology/users/IzzyOnDroid/statuses/101210904206926714):\n"
msgstr "**[@Izzy](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/izzy)**は[次のように書いています](https://mastodon.technology/users/IzzyOnDroid/statuses/101210904206926714)：\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "I've just put the first article of my F-Droid series online. \"F-Droid: The privacy-friendly alternative to Google Play Store\" can be found at [https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-1](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-1)."
msgstr "F-Droid連載の第1回記事を公開しました。「F-Droid：プライバシーに配慮したGoogle Playストアの代替」は、[https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-1](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-1)でご覧いただけます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "The German article is also online now at the same location."
msgstr "ドイツ語版の記事も同じ場所で公開されています。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet.md
msgid "![Article Screenshot]({% asset posts/2018-12-13-twif-34-f-droid-is-a-planet/izzy_ct_fdroid_article_part_1.jpg %})"
