msgid "For those who have been waiting, part 2 of **[@Izzy](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/izzy)**'s F-Droid series is now online: [F-Droid for advanced users and developers](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-2?lang=en). (In English. German version coming soon.)"
