#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2018-12-29-twif-36-f-droid-at-35c3-and-zdf.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "  ...but the big news is that thanks to the work of [Alex Palaistras](https://github.com/deuill), the minimum required Android version was lowered to Android 4.1. Previously, users who didn't have Android 4.4 (or newer) and users of Jolla/Blackberry devices with limited Android compatibility were stuck on Conversations 1.23.8, or needed to switch to **[Conversations Legacy](https://f-droid.org/packages/eu.siacs.conversations.legacy/)**. With this change, they can get up to date with the latest Conversations (and Quicksy) versions. That being said, be sure to read the whole [changelog](https://github.com/siacs/Conversations/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md) between 1.23.x and 2.3.10, so you don't get surprised by the new stuff (removed swipe, removed OTR, and so on and so forth).\n"
msgstr "  …しかし、最大のニュースは、[Alex Palaistras](https://github.com/deuill)の取り組みにより、必要なAndroidの最低バージョンがAndroid 4.1まで引き下げられたことです。これまでは、Android 4.4以降を搭載していないユーザーや、Android互換性に制限のあるJolla/BlackBerry端末のユーザーは、Conversations 1.23.8を使い続けるか、**[Conversations Legacy](https://f-droid.org/packages/eu.siacs.conversations.legacy/)**に切り替える必要がありました。この変更により、最新のConversations（およびQuicksy）に更新できるようになりました。ただし、スワイプ操作の削除やOTRの削除など、新しい変更に驚かないよう、1.23.xから2.3.10までの[変更履歴](https://github.com/siacs/Conversations/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)をすべて確認してください。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2018-12-29-twif-36-f-droid-at-35c3-and-zdf.md
msgid "**[Mastalab](https://f-droid.org/packages/fr.gouv.etalab.mastodon/)** was [updated](https://gitlab.com/tom79/mastalab/tags) from 1.41.2 to 1.50.3:"
