msgid "Starting in January, [the European Commission is going to fund bug bounty programs for a number of open source projects](https://betanews.com/2018/12/30/european-commission-bug-bounty-open-source/), as part of the [FOSSA project](https://juliareda.eu/FOSSA/). Projects include Drupal, Notepad++, and of interest to F-Droid users: **[VLC](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.videolan.vlc/)**."
