msgid "**[Riot.im](https://f-droid.org/packages/im.vector.alpha/)** 0.8.21 [made](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-android/blob/HEAD/CHANGES.rst) it into F-Droid, with the following improvements:"
msgstr "**[Riot.im](https://f-droid.org/packages/im.vector.alpha/)** 0.8.21がF-Droidで[提供されるようになり](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-android/blob/HEAD/CHANGES.rst)、以下の改善が加えられました："

