msgid "Show userId below display name in member detail screen ([#2756](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-android/issues/2756))"
msgstr "メンバー詳細画面で、表示名の下にユーザーIDを表示（[#2756](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-android/issues/2756)）"

