#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2019-01-05-twif-37-the-european-bug-bounty-edition.md
msgid "**[AddressToGPS](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/me.danielbarnett.addresstogps)** was [moved to the archive](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/merge_requests/4207) because the network service it relies on stopped working recently, and there hasn't been activity from the app's maintainer in over 2 years. For more details, see [this issue](https://github.com/DanielBarnett714/AddressToGPS/issues/13). As replacement, we suggest **[Acastus Photon](https://f-droid.org/packages/name.gdr.acastus_photon/)**, or although heavy, **[OsmAnd~](https://f-droid.org/packages/net.osmand.plus/)** which can look up addresses even when offline."
msgstr "**[AddressToGPS](https://f-droid.org/wiki/page/me.danielbarnett.addresstogps)**は、依存しているネットワークサービスが最近機能しなくなり、アプリのメンテナーによる活動も2年以上確認されていないため、[アーカイブに移されました](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/merge_requests/4207)。詳しくは、[こちらのIssue](https://github.com/DanielBarnett714/AddressToGPS/issues/13)をご覧ください。代替アプリとして、**[Acastus Photon](https://f-droid.org/packages/name.gdr.acastus_photon/)**、または容量は大きいものの、オフラインでも住所を検索できる**[OsmAnd~](https://f-droid.org/packages/net.osmand.plus/)**をおすすめします。"

