msgid "[The Rocky Road to TLS 1.3 and better Internet Encryption](https://media.ccc.de/v/35c3-9607-the_rocky_road_to_tls_1_3_and_better_internet_encryption)"
msgstr "[TLS 1.3 とより安全なインターネット暗号化への険しい道のり](https://media.ccc.de/v/35c3-9607-the_rocky_road_to_tls_1_3_and_better_internet_encryption)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
