#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-02-01-twif-41-the-third-reproducible-app-edition.md
msgid "See: [F-Droid for advanced users and developers](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-2). This article has earlier been released [in English](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-2?lang=en) (on-line) and in print in c't magazine. In agreement with c't magazine, the German articles will be posted with a delay. As such, part 3 will be out in a few weeks, after the print version has been published."
msgstr "こちらをご覧ください：[上級ユーザーと開発者向けのF-Droid](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-2)。この記事は以前、[英語版](https://android.izzysoft.de/articles/named/fdroid-intro-2?lang=en)がオンラインで公開され、c't誌にも掲載されました。c't誌との合意により、ドイツ語の記事は遅れて公開されます。そのため、第3回は印刷版の掲載後、数週間以内に公開される予定です。"

