#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2019-02-17-twif-43-the-android-rebuilt-edition-alpha.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First alpha of android-rebuilds is up"
msgstr "android-rebuildsの最初のアルファ版が公開"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-02-17-twif-43-the-android-rebuilt-edition-alpha.md
msgid "The first alpha of the android-rebuilds repo for sdkmanager is up: [https://mirror.f-droid.org/android-free/repository/repository.xml](https://mirror.f-droid.org/android-free/repository/repository.xml)"
msgstr "sdkmanager向けandroid-rebuildsリポジトリの最初のアルファ版が公開されました：[https://mirror.f-droid.org/android-free/repository/repository.xml](https://mirror.f-droid.org/android-free/repository/repository.xml)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-02-17-twif-43-the-android-rebuilt-edition-alpha.md
msgid "This is the free software rebuild of all the Android SDK components, done by **[@beuc](https://gitlab.com/beuc)**. See: [https://forum.f-droid.org/t/call-for-help-making-free-software-builds-of-the-android-sdk/](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/call-for-help-making-free-software-builds-of-the-android-sdk/)"
msgstr "­これは、**[@beuc](https://gitlab.com/beuc)**によって行われた、Android SDKの全コンポーネントを自由ソフトウェアとして再ビルドしたものです。詳しくは、[https://forum.f-droid.org/t/call-for-help-making-free-software-builds-of-the-android-sdk/](https://forum.f-droid.org/t/call-for-help-making-free-software-builds-of-the-android-sdk/)をご覧ください。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-02-17-twif-43-the-android-rebuilt-edition-alpha.md
msgid "The goal is to get it so that apps can use it instead of maven.google.com and any of the Google packages. It is very alpha, so anything could change or break at this point."
msgstr "目標は、アプリがmaven.google.comやGoogleの各種パッケージの代わりにこれを利用できるようにすることです。まだごく初期のアルファ版であるため、現時点では何が変更されたり壊れたりしてもおかしくありません。"

