#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calendar Notifications Plus unpublished from Play Store"
msgstr "Calendar Notifications PlusがPlayストアでの公開を終了"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
msgid "The developer of **[Calendar Notifications](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.quarck.calnotify/)** has [pulled their app from Google Play](https://www.reddit.com/comments/auiv3b), while leaving it on FDroid:"
msgstr "**[Calendar Notifications](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.github.quarck.calnotify/)**の開発者は、F-Droidでの公開は継続しつつ、[Google Playでのアプリ公開を終了しました](https://www.reddit.com/comments/auiv3b)："

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> I have realized yesterday that Play Store was a source of a constant stress recently. And for what? For an app that I develop as a fun-time activity and having absolutely zero profit from it. Recent SDK/API changes has forced me to kill/change some functionality that people liked and people were blaming me, not google.\n"
msgstr "> 昨日、最近ではPlayストアが絶え間ないストレスの原因になっていたことに気付きました。それも何のために？ 趣味として開発していて、利益がまったくないアプリのためです。最近のSDK／APIの変更により、利用者に好評だった一部の機能を削除または変更せざるを得なくなりましたが、責められたのはGoogleではなく私でした。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
msgid "**[LASKmobile](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.rfo.LASKmobile/)**: Data entry app for the field record LASK."
msgstr "**[LASKmobile](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.rfo.LASKmobile/)**：フィールド記録「LASK」向けのデータ入力アプリです。"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
msgid "**[Mozc for Android](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.mozc.android.inputmethod.japanese/)**: Japanese input method editor."
msgstr "**[Mozc for Android](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.mozc.android.inputmethod.japanese/)**：日本語入力用のIMEです。"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2019-03-01-twif-45-localization-improvements-and-faster-news.md
msgid "**[EteSync](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.etesync.syncadapter/)** is a secure and end-to-end encrypted personal information sync for Android, the desktop and the web. (You will either need a paid account, or set up your own server.) It was [updated](https://github.com/etesync/android/blob/HEAD/ChangeLog.md) from 1.2.0 to 1.2.2, fixing the setting controlling change notifications, and fixing a crash during sync for some users."
msgstr "**[EteSync](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.etesync.syncadapter/)**は、Android、デスクトップ、Webで個人情報を安全にエンドツーエンド暗号化して同期するサービスです。（有料アカウントを利用するか、自分でサーバーを構築する必要があります。）1.2.0から1.2.2に[更新され](https://github.com/etesync/android/blob/HEAD/ChangeLog.md)、変更通知を制御する設定の不具合と、一部の利用者で同期中に発生していたクラッシュが修正されました。"

