#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
msgid "In this edition: The [guardianproject.info](https://guardianproject.info/) website migration effort is underway, and odds-and-ends.  There are **{{ page.number_of_added_apps }}** new and **{{ page.number_of_updated_apps }}** updated apps."
msgstr "今回の内容：[guardianproject.info](https://guardianproject.info/)ウェブサイトの移行作業が進行中、その他いろいろ。新規アプリは **{{ page.number_of_added_apps }}** 件、更新されたアプリは **{{ page.number_of_updated_apps }}** 件です。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guardian Project Hugo Migration"
msgstr "Guardian ProjectのHugoへの移行"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[Coffee](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/coffee)** and **[@\\_hc](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/hans)** have been working to migrate the [guardianproject.info](https://guardianproject.info/) website to Hugo. The site has been set up, and much of the content has been migrated, but work remains to get all the details right and port over the navigation.\n"
msgstr "**[Coffee](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/coffee)**と**[@\\_hc](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/hans)**は、[guardianproject.info](https://guardianproject.info/)ウェブサイトをHugoへ移行する作業を進めています。サイトの構築とコンテンツの大部分の移行は完了していますが、細部を整え、ナビゲーションを移植する作業が残っています。\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Google Play Issues"
msgstr "Google Playの問題"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)** points to a story about [KDE Connect](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.kde.kdeconnect_tp/) being briefly [removed](https://mobile.twitter.com/albertvaka/status/1107924633750253568) from the Google Play Store, ostensibly for violating Google's [new policy](https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9047303) on apps that utilize SMS permissions, despite an exemption that clearly applied to KDE Connect. It was [restored](https://mobile.twitter.com/albertvaka/status/1108648884056834048) two days later.\n"
msgstr "**[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)**は、SMS権限を使用するアプリに関するGoogleの[新しいポリシー](https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9047303)に違反したとして、[KDE Connect](https://f-droid.org/packages/org.kde.kdeconnect_tp/)がGoogle Playストアから一時的に[削除された](https://mobile.twitter.com/albertvaka/status/1107924633750253568)件を紹介しています。KDE Connectには明らかに適用される例外規定があったにもかかわらずです。2日後には[復元されました](https://mobile.twitter.com/albertvaka/status/1108648884056834048)。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**[@Poussinou](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/poussinou)** highlighted some troubles for the [MusicPiped](https://f-droid.org/packages/deep.ryd.rydplayer/) app, which allows users to stream audio from Youtube. It was [published to Google Play](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=deep.ryd.rydplayer), however its primary function violates Google's Terms of Service. Google have responded by [denying](https://github.com/deep-gaurav/MusicPiped/issues/2#issuecomment-472364321) update submissions from the developer, though updates continue to be available via F-Droid.\n"
msgstr "**[@Poussinou](https://forum.f-droid.org/u/poussinou)**は、YouTubeから音声をストリーミング再生できる[MusicPiped](https://f-droid.org/packages/deep.ryd.rydplayer/)で起きている問題を取り上げました。このアプリは[Google Playで公開されました](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=deep.ryd.rydplayer)が、主要機能がGoogleの利用規約に違反しています。Googleは開発者による更新の申請を[却下しています](https://github.com/deep-gaurav/MusicPiped/issues/2#issuecomment-472364321)が、F-Droidでは引き続き更新版を入手できます。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: _posts/2019-03-23-twif-48.md
msgid "**[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)** has let us know about part 2 of a series on lineageos (German): [LineageOS – Take back control](https://www.kuketz-blog.de/lineageos-take-back-control-teil2/)."
msgstr "**[@vanitasvitae](https://gitlab.com/vanitasvitae)**から、LineageOSに関する連載の第2回（ドイツ語）について知らせがありました：[LineageOS – Take back control](https://www.kuketz-blog.de/lineageos-take-back-control-teil2/)。"

