msgstr "[fdroiddata](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/-/merge_requests) または [rfp](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) のアプリをレビューする"

#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2020-03-04-f-droid-is-a-key-source-for-academics-and-researchers.md
msgid "Lastly, if you are a researcher or academic working with F-Droid data, please come by and say hi! We are always interested to hear about how people are using our work."
