msgid "Application ID: [RFP](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/rfp/issuebot/applicationIds.json) / [_fdroiddata_](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/fdroiddata/issuebot/applicationIds.json)"
msgstr "アプリケーション ID：[RFP](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/rfp/issuebot/applicationIds.json) / [_fdroiddata_](https://fdroid.gitlab.io/fdroiddata/issuebot/applicationIds.json)"

#. type: Plain text
