msgid "[Lavabit Encrypted Proxy](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.lavabit.pahoehoe/)"
msgstr "[Lavabit Encrypted Proxy](https://f-droid.org/packages/com.lavabit.pahoehoe/)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
