#. type: Plain text
#: _posts/2024-04-29-board-appointments-2024.md
msgid "During 2024, the Board of Directors intends to form new subcommittees to establish additional points of liaison between the Board and those interested in specific aspects of F-Droid's activities (fundraising, for instance).  If the prospect of participating in such discussions interests you, please keep an eye out for further announcements! Board meetings continue to be open to the entire community, and will be announced in advance on the [F-Droid Forum](https://forum.f-droid.org/)."
msgstr "2024年中に、理事会は新たな小委員会を設置し、理事会と、F-Droidの活動の特定分野（たとえば資金調達）に関心を持つ人々との連携窓口を増やす予定です。 こうした議論への参加に関心がある方は、今後のお知らせをご確認ください。理事会の会議は引き続きコミュニティ全体に公開され、事前に[F-Droidフォーラム](https://forum.f-droid.org/)で告知されます。"

